---
/**
 * Atalho - Bottom Banner
 * Call to action at the bottom of the page
 */
---

<section class="bottom-banner">
  <span class="banner-star" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
  <div>
    <h2>Seu jeito de criar é único.</h2>
    <p>Use os prompts como ponto de partida. O toque final é seu.</p>
  </div>
  <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="bottom-guide">Aprenda a personalizar <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
</section>

<style>
  .bottom-banner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
    background: var(--color-surface-sunken);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
  }

  .banner-star {
    font-size: 2.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-lime-600);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .bottom-banner > div { max-width: 480px; }

  .bottom-banner h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }

  .bottom-banner p {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .bottom-banner { flex-wrap: wrap; padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-5); gap: var(--space-3); }
    .bottom-banner h2 { font-size: 1rem; }
    .bottom-banner button { margin-left: auto; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .bottom-banner { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-4); }
    .bottom-banner > div { max-width: 14.0625rem; }
    .bottom-banner h2 { font-size: 1.0625rem; }
    .bottom-banner p { font-size: 0.625rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .bottom-banner button { margin-left: auto; font-size: 0.5625rem; padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3); }
  }
</style>